# Environment for this directory, added to prat's list rather than replacing it.
# Syntax: NAME or +NAME forwards, -PATTERN drops; see $CONFIG_DIR/env.
#
# Every '-' line applies to what this file forwards, so a name matching *TOKEN*,
# *SECRET*, *API_KEY* or another credential pattern is dropped even when named
# here. This file is read out of the target directory, so a repository you clone
# cannot widen your environment onto a credential. To forward one, name it in
# $CONFIG_DIR/env.local, outside the repository.
